                                        "glosses": [
                                            "tetraiodo-fluorescein, a cherry-pink fluorone used as a food colouring, in printing inks, and as a biological stain, a dental plaque disclosing agent and a radiopaque medium."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
